    {
      "id": "a2-02",
      "title": "Conversation glue",
      "goal": "The little words that hold every conversation together.",
      "note": "These sit in the top few hundred words of spoken Catalan. Learn them as chunks:\n\n- **Hola!** **Adéu!** **Bona nit.**\n- **De debò?** (¿De verdad?) — **Realment** (realmente)\n- **Suposo que sí.** (Supongo que sí.)\n- **Exactament.** **Perfecte.**\n- **Endavant!** (¡Adelante!) — **Tranquil.** (Tranquilo.)\n- **No importa.** **No passa res.**\n- **Què vol dir?** (¿Qué significa?)\n- **Perdona** (tú) / **Perdoni** (usted)",
