    {
      "id": "a2-05",
      "title": "Articles and contractions",
      "goal": "Use el, la, l', the contractions al/del/pel, and the article before names.",
      "note": "**el / la / els / les**, and **l'** before a vowel or h: **l'home**, **l'amiga**. Exception: la stays before unstressed i/u: **la universitat**.\n\nContractions: **a + el = al**, **de + el = del**, **per + el = pel** (and **als, dels, pels**).\n\nCatalan puts an article before people's names: **en Joan**, **la Maria**, **l'Anna**.",
